[en.FOCUS_C18_010_KAN]
Kan

[en.FOCUS_C18_010_KAN_desc]
Kan, the water flows endlessly, laboring tirelessly, just like our diligent Kirins.\n“Water can overcome fire, when water rises, fire is extinguished.”\nLet the hardworking Kirins obtain their rightful §Crights§!, then we can quell their anger and keep our society away from destruction.\nBut at the same time, the Yang sandwiched in the Yins indicates profound and unpredictable, layers of dangers, sensitive social issues need more careful and wise handling.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_010_KAN]
坎

[zh.FOCUS_C18_010_KAN_desc]
坎，水流不息，劳而不倦，正如我们勤劳的麒麟们。\n“水能克火，水兴则火息。”\n让勤恳工作的麒麟们获得他们应有的§C权利§!，则能平息他们的怒火，让我们的社会远离毁灭。\n但与此同时，阳陷阴中预示着渊深不测，重重险难，敏感的社会问题需要更加细心和智慧的处理。

